{
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "01",
      "text": "My sister left a blue jar beside the gate."
    },
    {
      "id": "02",
      "text": "She did not break it; I did."
    },
    {
      "id": "03",
      "text": "I never said you were the one who left."
    },
    {
      "id": "04",
      "text": "Not because I stopped loving you, but because I could not make you stay."
    },
    {
      "id": "09",
      "text": "It wasn't you who was looking at the moon, it was me."
    },
    {
      "id": "10",
      "text": "The light didn't go out, only I closed my eyes."
    },
    {
      "id": "11",
      "text": "I didn't say I wouldn't go home. I said I couldn't go home tonight."
    },
    {
      "id": "12",
      "text": "My friend didn't turn the lights off. The wind's off."
    },
    {
      "id": "13",
      "text": "It's not that he's sad he's gone, but that he can't say goodbye."
    },
    {
      "id": "14",
      "text": "Come back, come back, I didn't wait yesterday, it's today."
    }
  ],
